      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Chemical Reaction"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Chemical reactions represent processes where chemical bonds are broken and formed to yield new substances.",
        "Chemical equations must be balanced to obey the Law of Conservation of Mass.",
        "Reactions are categorized into key types based on energy changes, oxygen transfer, and combination patterns.",
        "Oxidation and reduction occur simultaneously as redox processes during chemical transformations.",
        "Corrosion and rancidity are everyday impacts of oxidation that alter metals and fats/oils."
      ],
      "id": "u1fz7ba"
